  "prefLabel": "Pda 502.29 Vessel used primarily for commercial use purposes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 502.29 “Vessel used primarily for commercial use purposes” means a commercial vessel not utilized for noncommercial use for more than 14 days cumulatively during the period from April 1 to March 31.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; renumbered by #8775 (from Pda 502.28); ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (formerly Pda 502.31) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
